  # [ASSUMPTION: confidence=low] Write-back timeout is 30 seconds per episode
  @edge-case @integration
  Scenario: Graphiti connection timeout during write-back does not hang the session
    Given the Graphiti service becomes slow mid-write
    And the write-back timeout is 30 seconds per episode
    When an episode write exceeds the timeout
    Then the timed-out episode should be logged as a warning
    And remaining episodes should still be attempted
    And the session should complete within a bounded time

